---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import siteData from '../data/siteData.json';
---

<Layout
  title={`Volunteering – ${siteData.group.name}`}
  description="Our Group is entirely volunteer led. Find out how to join Donnybrook Scout Group as an adult volunteer—full training provided and no prior experience required."
>
  <Hero
    title="Volunteering With Us"
    subtitle="Full training is provided and no prior Scouting experience is required."
    eyebrow="100% Volunteer Led"
    image="/images/hero-volunteering.jpg"
    minHeight="360px"
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container volunteer-content">
      <div class="volunteer-prose">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Community &amp; Leadership</span>
        <h2>Make a Lasting Impact in Donnybrook</h2>
        <p>
          Our Group is entirely volunteer led and joining the Group as an adult is a great way to
          connect to the community.
        </p>
        <p>
          Scouting gives an incredible opportunity to work with young people in the community who
          are aged 6 upwards. This opportunity will not only allow you to help develop the future
          of these young people and their future contribution to your area, but will also be a lot
          of fun.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you have a passion for the outdoors or if you see a healthy and active lifestyle as
          essential to a happy life, Scouting is a great opportunity to instill those values in the
          young people you work with.
        </p>
        <p>
          One of Scouting’s main goals is also to instill community spirit and leave the world a
          little better than you found it.
        </p>
        <p>
          There is a very close network of adult volunteers already working in the Group that will
          help you develop and integrate socially when you join. Full training is provided and no
          prior experience is required.
        </p>
        <p class="volunteer-cta-copy">
          To discuss your options, please go to our{' '}
          <a href="/join-us"><strong>Join Us Page</strong></a> and get in touch – we’ll take it from
          there.
        </p>
        <div class="volunteer-actions">
          <a href="/join-us" class="btn btn-red btn-lg">Apply as an Adult Volunteer</a>
          <a href={`mailto:${siteData.group.emails.apply}`} class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg">
            Email {siteData.group.emails.apply}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="volunteer-highlights">
        <div class="card highlight-box">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3>No Prior Experience Needed</h3>
            <p>
              Whether you enjoy hiking, administration, DIY at the hall, or weekly youth
              programmes, full Scouting Ireland training and Garda vetting support are provided.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card highlight-box">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3>Flexible Ways to Help</h3>
            <p>
              Support a Beaver Colony, Cub Pack, Scout Troop, or Venture Crew weekly, or help with
              Group Council, fundraising, equipment, and hall upkeep.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card highlight-box">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3>Waiting List Preference</h3>
            <p>
              Families who offer to get involved as volunteers receive preference on our Waiting
              List, helping us open up more youth places across Dublin 4 and 6.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Volunteer Life</span>
        <h2>Our Leaders in Action</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-grid">
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/rovers-2.jpg" alt="Adult leaders and Rovers" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/hero-home.jpg" alt="Scouts and leaders gathering" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/volunteer-1.jpg" alt="Scouting leaders volunteering" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item">
          <img src="/images/volunteer-2.jpg" alt="Outdoor camp leadership" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .volunteer-content {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .volunteer-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    }
  }

  .volunteer-prose h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
  }

  .volunteer-prose p {
    font-size: 1.03rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .volunteer-cta-copy a {
    color: var(--color-scout-red);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .volunteer-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .volunteer-highlights {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .highlight-box {
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-scout-red);
  }

  .highlight-box h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .highlight-box p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 0.93rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }
</style>
